  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Uppusetty Ravi vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 22 October, 2020 Author: K.Suresh Reddy Bench: K.Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K.Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.4775 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "1. This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner / Accused under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in F.I.R.No.368 of 2019, on the file of Vedayapalem Police Station, Nellore, SPSR Nellore District. The alleged offences against the petitioner are under sections 328, 273 and 188 of IPC and Sections 58 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "2. Heard Sri Raja Reddy Koneti, learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent / State. 3. Both the counsels agree that this matter is squarely covered by the Judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
